+    // true deactivation iOS NEVER tells other apps (Spotify / YouTube / the Music app)
+    // that our .duckOthers session has ended, so their audio stays stuck at ~half
+    // volume for minutes after a Nova/comms clip finishes. NotifyOthersOnDeactivation
